# Project Memory Bank

The notes-file rule in `~/.claude/CLAUDE.md` covers routine use. This skill adds the scripts.

## Notes file
`.agents/memory/activeContext.md` in the repo root. Sections: **Done**, **In progress**, **Next**, **Dead ends** (with why). Keep it under ~150 lines; collapse finished items into one-line summaries.

## Checkpoints (git working state)
```
python3 ~/.claude/skills/project-memory-bank/scripts/state_checkpoint.py save -m "<label>"
python3 ~/.claude/skills/project-memory-bank/scripts/state_checkpoint.py list
python3 ~/.claude/skills/project-memory-bank/scripts/state_checkpoint.py restore <id>
```
Save one before a risky refactor or a long decomp batch.

## Task velocity guard
`python3 ~/.claude/skills/project-memory-bank/scripts/task_velocity_guard.py {start,step,status,finish}` — timeboxes a task and flags diminishing returns.
